219 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 198 0 R
/E ( I designed the cooling manifolds directly into the motors' 3D-printed mounts, fed by a single fitting into each mount. Routing the air through the mount itself put cooling right at the motor and cut the time to cool in half.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
220 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 198 0 R
/Pg 10 0 R
/A [742 0 R 0]
