256 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 200 0 R
/E (Tennis Buddy is an autonomous-capable robot that acts as a tennis training partner, firing consistent volleys with adjustable spin. It has a full drivetrain, a flywheel shooter, an actuated hood, gravity-fed loading, onboard cameras, and a laptop interface. We designed and built all of it in 24 hours, including machining the polycarbonate plates.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
