/T (Using SolidWorks Simulation \(FEA\), I performed design studies to evaluate different cross-sectional profiles, wall thicknesses, and material distributions. Through iterative refinement, I identified and reinforced high-stress regions while reducing unnecessary mass. The optimized geometry achieved the 3rd lowest deflection-to-weight ratio among all competing designs, demonstrating exceptional stiffness efficiency and strong performance relative to weight.)
